{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "adaded26fe848b32318e9c36406dd224bce2eb000eb7857aced50417a8d9c256", "ja": "終演☆また会う日まで！", "zh": "落幕☆直到再次相会的那天！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3fa2b8f12df9d27737f715ac1157d1012bc52670f2ecc1b3ae776c969c1edde5", "ja": "観客全員を人質にされてしまい、絶体絶命の\nトゥインクルリズム。しかし、みんなの応援\nのおかげでドリームパワーがチャージ完了！\nひなたを救出、ギョーカイジンを撃退する。\nこうして、町の平和は守られたのだった。", "zh": "全场观众被劫持为人质，闪耀律动陷入绝体绝命的危机。然而，在大家的加油鼓励下，梦想动力充能完毕！成功救出向日葵，击退了业界人，小镇的和平就此得以守护。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1000_035hin", "source_sha256": "e4282c1c990d9e13183aea1e938df68284d96e6ac1b1ec35ee4811826783291a", "ja": "ううっ、育ちゃんごめんねぇ。\nあたしのせいで、また迷惑かけたべさ……。", "zh": "呜呜，小育，对不起呀。都怪我，又给你添麻烦了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "7b30db49f038c149670f57efae37711ffe91e4764d02eb613aa9270e30168424", "ja": "ううん、迷惑なんかじゃないよ！\nぜったいに助けるからね！", "zh": "才没有添麻烦呢！\n我一定会救你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "29d4868860218bd9aaf6b2f6912dd41d6983c060ba68902d678b0b589ffbef26", "ja": "貴様らの友情ごっこにはヘドが出る！\nやってしまえシースー団！", "zh": "我对你们那场友情游戏已经恶心得想吐了！\n上吧，寿司团！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "e882d9a66309888fbeaa072a6b717fc0f0af4ea4436a9143335a4c2ab8ac8b60", "ja": "うふふっ！　私のかわいいグーフー団♪\nこの会場をめちゃくちゃにしなさいっ！", "zh": "呵呵！我可爱的河豚团♪\n去把这个会场搅得一塌糊涂吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1004_shisuguhu", "source_sha256": "bc9a332b6adece9b7d882e52e9118b138fc26755e10710c1199fd036b65fe7e9", "ja": "シャリシャリ―！\nギョイィィィッ！", "zh": "咔嚓咔嚓——！\n嘎吱吱吱——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "cd135b3f501f51bd64e7b5132dd206678ee588b220287601d2407381fd53aafe", "ja": "あっ！　シースー団とグーフー団が客席へ！\nこれじゃ、会場にいる全員が人質だわ。", "zh": "啊！寿司团和河豚团冲进观众席了！\n这样一来，现场所有人都成了人质。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "82617b46790b23a2a489c33db078d4f7acff8618ed28ae2b34fb2b9c995b8a68", "ja": "でも、今のありさ達では大勢を相手にできません。\nドリームパワーが圧倒的に足りないんです！", "zh": "但是，现在的我们还无法对付这么多人。\n梦想力量远远不够！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "bf8cb2c861b24d3089f8a455ff5098bff32348e44ab4f3f35bfc222387c8a4c1", "ja": "わたし達に、もっと力が……\nドリームパワーがあれば、みんなを助けられるのに！", "zh": "要是我们能有更多力量……\n要是拥有梦想的力量，就能帮助大家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1008_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "81892d35d05092a8238a992712d800a1a99497b52ca1e0d5895d26fee84f1163", "ja": "……がんばれーっ！　トゥインクルリズムー！", "zh": "……加油啊——！闪光节奏——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "1a03a5443fe6bfc7d37abf926a3feafc74a2c70b430b3d76941d0e847b975777", "ja": "そうだ！　みんなのドリームパワーで\nトゥインクルリズムを助けてあげよう！", "zh": "对了！让我们用大家的梦想力量，去帮助闪耀节奏吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "f0c3e094a47cf072b1990d9e57902e39fb2ef380f58c93cf8b9964c4bf79f352", "ja": "大きい声で応援してね！\nせーの……頑張れー、トゥインクルリズムー！", "zh": "大声为她们加油吧！\n预备……加油啊——，闪耀旋律——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1012_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "87cb467f0decc6d9b96a69df22f1b62fcc464a1892a056d65084cbcc0e283aae", "ja": "がんばれ、がんばれーっ！！", "zh": "加油，加油——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "8c8fb392d469b294f6fea80b8a2defe952ad08c05edfc4a971ca818927c2e51f", "ja": "な、なんなのこのパワーは！\nもしかして、ここにいる全員が魔法少女なの！？", "zh": "这、这是什么力量啊！\n难道说，在场的所有人都是魔法少女！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "f6fc5e13ec0b57cf3c19d573b2809f337701138932d7a85d92da119c1193021b", "ja": "ぐぐっ……声が頭に響いて、動きが……！\nおいっ！　なんとかしろシースー団、グーフー団！", "zh": "呜呜……声音在脑海里回响，身体动不了了……！\n喂！寿司团、河豚团，快想想办法！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1015_shisuguhu", "source_sha256": "bfaa5fee2f6234a16c1285727124567d97b0f59427598687ea15492405bbcc7a", "ja": "シャ……シャリー……。\nギョ、ギョ……ッ。", "zh": "莎……莎莉……。\n鱼、鱼……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1016_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "60b9f61667a1564cdfbaa1e6b1777a48f7c506ad5197f91a19ca9d3ca43d62aa", "ja": "がんばれ、トゥインクルリズムー！！", "zh": "加油，Twinkle Rhythm——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "41773cd673946ee579d58534ccfaad00199dd1941f1f33076db98cf18e6731b4", "ja": "あっ。体中に力がみなぎってくる……。\nもしかして、会場のみんなのドリームパワーが？", "zh": "啊。感觉全身都充满了力量……。\n难道是会场上大家的梦想力量？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "a4fe10c767ce41479f9f014e09f3d6638a2bc99e5535d33280d2e5ee02c00fe5", "ja": "ああっ！？　ありさのウィップにドリームパワーが！\nこれなら人質を奪還できるかもですっ！　えーいっ！", "zh": "啊！？亚利沙的鞭子上出现了梦想的力量！\n这样说不定能夺回人质了！嘿——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1019_null", "source_sha256": "dddbcbc8afe8d5afb2ae6b741d59e1a440cf3f5b48bbbdbb5d8f6b07941e4cd5", "ja": "シュルシュルシュル……パシッ！", "zh": "窸窸窣窣……啪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1020_010azu", "source_sha256": "15b9ba339f4c8aef22cb785b1bb7478905982fe62e177d31a018f42efd0a27e6", "ja": "キャッ！？　なんだったの、今の光……？\nって、人質がいないわっ！？", "zh": "呀！？刚才那道光是怎么回事……？\n等等，人质不见了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "91de332758342c1331667de5425839a9cf54e63092d9296f96d717f76ffb7fd7", "ja": "ひなたさん！　大丈夫？　ケガはない？", "zh": "日向！没事吧？有没有受伤？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "b2a8dee1de02dff869ec510e415fbccd9746c083349cd4455efae31b16f71ec0", "ja": "うん、大丈夫だよぉ！\nありがとねぇ、亜利沙さん、それにみんな！", "zh": "嗯，我没事哦！\n谢谢你，亚利沙，还有大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "5d782d17ad2296c871b65aff1848e9fb97975f9e44ccc16ec83315ff64bac356", "ja": "ひなたちゃん！\n春香さんと一緒に安全なところに避難してください！", "zh": "日向！请和春香一起避难到安全的地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "1aec41e6fb8829477597938052de63e80ad3256a8aac20759179045299f6684f", "ja": "みんなのドリームパワーをもらった今なら……！\nアリサ、プリンセス！　準備はいい？", "zh": "获得了大家梦想的力量，现在的话……！\n亚利沙、公主！准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1025_030iku", "source_sha256": "ee251d505d673a5e4c240e8ad7fa8732e4090202fd63fa4afaba529a0435d160", "ja": "うんっ！／はいっ！", "zh": "嗯！／好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1026_028ari", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1027_030iku", "source_sha256": "f016dbbc5502eaa08552271e2f6db1dc1c4b2f7195cd612ac7be91ca5c92cd15", "ja": "愛の光よ！", "zh": "爱之光啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "afa92bd2fff3305eed6014f6fe0c50575a63ab7820dd6451623826d3b3ddbb58", "ja": "闇を消し去れ！", "zh": "消灭黑暗吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1029_028ari", "source_sha256": "a2af190fd3053ab9d90fcbbc65215b3f498bf7399a6a40505c8db144a2b4cc56", "ja": "チョー必殺ぅ～……", "zh": "超级必杀～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1030_030iku", "source_sha256": "45660ba35ada10e5f75dccf6d34ee4c97839a71abedc01a2ee9ecdf681946a75", "ja": "トゥインクル・トライアングル・アターーック！！", "zh": "闪耀・三角・攻击～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1031_026yur", "source_sha256": "45660ba35ada10e5f75dccf6d34ee4c97839a71abedc01a2ee9ecdf681946a75", "ja": "トゥインクル・トライアングル・アターーック！！", "zh": "闪耀・三角・攻击～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1032_028ari", "source_sha256": "45660ba35ada10e5f75dccf6d34ee4c97839a71abedc01a2ee9ecdf681946a75", "ja": "トゥインクル・トライアングル・アターーック！！", "zh": "闪耀・三角・攻击～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1033_006mak", "source_sha256": "375aa8cdde2a8b2329a2c68928bf2ef726234e665504b198e0c86f1bf4f96fb8", "ja": "ギャァァァァッ！？", "zh": "呀啊啊啊啊啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1034_010azu", "source_sha256": "8c67c09f6752f20dca4a14f60deb281d6e69325f8cd3e0ed53c6466b9c225a2e", "ja": "キャァァァァッ！？", "zh": "呀啊啊啊啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1035_null", "source_sha256": "5e137d008a74818167128a049167b0a0cfc7129fc5bcc5fe105e2296cc5ce54c", "ja": "チュドーーーン！", "zh": "轰————！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1036_006mak", "source_sha256": "ae6aeb0881b3c61c4bece4777588210c76d13de53a569ea702505159fb2a1f81", "ja": "クソッ。お前達、退くぞ！\nトゥインクルリズムめ……覚えてろよっ！", "zh": "可恶。你们，撤退！\nTwinkle Rhythm……给我记住了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1037_010azu", "source_sha256": "01b5fdb7a7d261f9f4419f8d2fa1ef69f54fdfe2b1f29ecda150a04b6851bf14", "ja": "きょ、今日のところは見逃してあげるわ。\n次こそは必ず……うふふっ。また会いましょう♪", "zh": "今、今日のところは放过你们吧。\n下次一定要……呜呼呼。我们再见吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1039_001har", "source_sha256": "8f041cfe43d1414ba41da726aad8764c16b505e9c0e462f41f112df7cc746639", "ja": "会場のみんなの応援で、\n悪のギョーカイジンが逃げていっちゃった！", "zh": "多亏了会场里大家的加油，邪恶的业内人士逃走了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1040_026yur", "source_sha256": "d23de2d269051734a4e10da6c8b82864b62324b42400d59898eb03d6c34d25c8", "ja": "応援ありがとうございました！　みんなの\nドリームパワーが私達に勇気を与えてくれました！", "zh": "谢谢大家的加油！大家的梦想力量给予了我们勇气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1041_028ari", "source_sha256": "2757ab36e63b1ef97115eaabb8d3a0a369fcea2f8bab9f2ec639ab3a02fa6c8a", "ja": "はい。ひなたちゃんを救出できたのも、\n会場の平和を守れたのも、みんなのおかげです！", "zh": "是的。多亏了大家，我们才能救出小日向，也才能守护会场的和平！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1042_030iku", "source_sha256": "5c226102c956c7463a1d3ab5ea669f3c0f475e8109040d9fdd72be46857162dd", "ja": "みんなの気持ち、ちゃんと届いたよ。ありがとう！\nわたし達、これからも平和を守るためにがんばるから。", "zh": "大家的心意，我切实感受到了。谢谢！\n我们今后也会为了守护和平而努力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1043_030iku", "source_sha256": "41232674998139701e94987d02e73d69376f45c01e3db2944dcb70256e75754d", "ja": "だから、いーっぱい応えんしてくれるとうれしいな♪\nわたし達との約束、守れるかな？", "zh": "所以，要是你们能给我们多多加油，我会很开心的♪  \n能遵守和我们的约定吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1044_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "bf707e18ee433dbc061ac0069df7c764dcbcc7452fbe51c7f54a2a4b3ef5490d", "ja": "はーーーい！", "zh": "好———的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1045_001har", "source_sha256": "b153190e1909a06a950ae8e744a8d1dfb52702c2d0f65c794b2872d0c5463182", "ja": "トゥインクルリズムのみんなは、ここでお別れです。\nこの後、見回りに行かなきゃいけないんだよね？", "zh": "闪耀节奏的大家，我们要在这里道别了。\n接下来还得去巡逻，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1046_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "4bb71e37be515e1237efe96dbf3384384b32b6818a495c35b134378406a30374", "ja": "えーー！", "zh": "诶——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0196_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0196_story_04_1047_030iku", "source_sha256": "1a6c814bf3d84b90d38addd60f33f3f2ee2f55d65ed4c4eec6890dfe501bf40a", "ja": "わたし達も一緒にいたいんだけど、これも使命なの！\nきっとまた会えるから。その時はまた一緒に遊ぼうね！", "zh": "我们也想继续待在一起，但这也是使命！\n一定还会再见面的。到时候我们再一起玩吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
